      "id": "claim_8d3b3c6f7c854c0b9ac218aecd5a5e79",
      "statement": "POST /shutdown on the internal listener starts the graceful handoff, and POST /shutdown?handoff=preserve prepares a clean same-node reload and keeps the ownership records.",
